{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>ולבכתה</b> — small kaf, for he wept only a little, since she was elderly. Or alternatively, she was as one who caused her own death, for she reported the judgment (of the Akeidah), and therefore she was punished first; and one who destroys oneself knowingly — they do not deliver eulogies over him."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:40.030553248Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}